      ],
      "books": [
        "main",
        "I"
      ],
      "pages": [
        {
          "html": "<p><a class=\"lore-link\" data-ref=\"I\">[I]</a> was sixteen and already bored of the assembly before it started.</p>\n<p>His mother — <a class=\"lore-link\" data-ref=\"IC\">mom</a> — had dropped him and his sister at the gate without a\nword, which was not like her.</p>",
          "refs": [
            "I",
            "IC"
          ],
          "factIds": [
            "i-first-day#0#0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "html": "<p><a class=\"lore-link\" data-ref=\"IA\">[IA]</a> found him by the lockers. &quot;Your sister okay? She looked like she&#39;d seen\na ghost.&quot;</p>\n<p>He shrugged it off. He was good at shrugging things off — better than he was at\nbeing right about them.</p>",
          "refs": [
            "IA",
            "I",
            "II"
          ],
          "factIds": [
            "i-first-day#1#0",
            "i-first-day#1#1"
